      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可是、可是……！那个，我已经长大了哦。\n已经可以把姐姐背起来了！我来背你怎吧……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffa4a9fdf085406a34e8ecf4122d6bbf34801f02e3b0c06a8a6ca3ead43df6a4",
