      "uid": "zhcn:a4b72fbbaef5969f38d95c4b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回想起，在即便如此也要坚持自己的主张，在那丰沛的——\n在那过于丰沛的感性与温柔面前，我不禁露出了微笑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea29a8c8778dd5193518807ea517bcc20d21b1080bec77b9a4154a71269a964e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
