    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d931fb4dff115394bbb3e2ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……回想起，一段时间后迷人景致去了一所\n为年幼马娘们学习跑步而设立的俱乐部。",
      "source_fingerprint": "821feddc8153c6a67bfcfcc3d6c7228325b5e8357d2055d0f0b266a33479f116",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1114/storytimeline_041114001.json",
